[{"client_msg_id":"43251d21-d830-4609-bcea-498aa7a6abba","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211109-2181690/\u003e\nこういうのがあったばっかりだしなぁ。","ts":"1636450437.429200","attachments":[{"fallback":"TECH+: 人気NPMパッケージ「coa」と「rc」、悪意のある第三者による改ざんが判明","id":1,"title":"人気NPMパッケージ「coa」と「rc」、悪意のある第三者による改ざんが判明","title_link":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211109-2181690/","text":"The Hacker Newsは11月7日(米国時間)、人気NPMパッケージである「coa」と「rc」において、悪意のある第三者による改ざんが発見されたと伝えた。いずれも、開発者のアカウントに対する不正アクセスによって、パスワードを盗むマルウェアを含むようにソースコードが変更されているという。","image_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211109-2181690/ogp_images/ogp.jpg","blocks":null,"ts":1636427931,"service_name":"TECH+","service_icon":"https://news.mynavi.jp/images/techplus/favicon_techplus.ico","from_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211109-2181690/","original_url":"https://news.mynavi.jp/article/20211109-2181690/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":6,"users":["UKHUVMBJR","UDPT2BZ6E","U01NKCTP7B4","U02269AAADD","UD1FQV38V","UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ue4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6bf4a2c9-d8ed-480a-870b-f25148f9de67","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"酷いとそうなるけど、まあ...\nあとdev系でも外部といろいろやりとりして開発結果物をつくることが絶無じゃないから、どうしても対象になるんだろうなあ....","ts":"1636450421.428900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"60P4d"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d0bfb50-e1f6-4e19-bea1-871ca3a06422","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"なるほど。でもまぁpostinstallが悪意ある設定されてるのって既に依存しているパッケージが乗っ取られてる系なので、また想定している状況が違いそうですね。","ts":"1636450361.427900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vvl/"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c9644c84-61b7-4f95-8ba6-b9c77ec3fd5e","type":"message","user":"U8996GYBF","text":"postinstallがありますね、設定されてたら走る","ts":"1636450264.426900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aPEu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ebc50962-19f7-4c3f-91ce-7a8ce54f6edd","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"npmはインストールした瞬間コード動くとかないんですかね？\n\nElispはインストールするとコンパイルが走るので、そこで任意のElispが実行できます。つまりインストールした瞬間に怪しげなパッケージは任意コードの実行ができます。。","ts":"1636450059.426400","edited":{"user":"UDPT2BZ6E","ts":"1636450080.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N7FBr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5955a607-d2f1-47bf-991d-6869333cd577","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"dev-dependenciesの脆弱性を出してくるのはちょっと邪魔感ありますね。","ts":"1636449976.425000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wen"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a6550af-bd81-4e24-8913-feb1b989647c","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"師曰く\n\u003chttps://overreacted.io/npm-audit-broken-by-design/\u003e\n:totemoturai:","ts":"1636448340.423800","thread_ts":"1636443798.387500","attachments":[{"fallback":"npm audit: Broken by Design","id":1,"title":"npm audit: Broken by Design","title_link":"https://overreacted.io/npm-audit-broken-by-design/","text":"Found 99 vulnerabilities (84 moderately irrelevant, 15 highly irrelevant)","blocks":null,"service_name":"overreacted.io","service_icon":"https://overreacted.io/icons/icon-48x48.png?v=8c19a894ebc3f54d282a8f2418cf5398","from_url":"https://overreacted.io/npm-audit-broken-by-design/","original_url":"https://overreacted.io/npm-audit-broken-by-design/"}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":2,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E","U02269AAADD"]},{"name":"chimeisyou","count":1,"users":["U02269AAADD"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"p0A"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"C8E51F17-EB5D-41BB-ACC3-AF41D399B4D9","type":"message","user":"U02269AAADD","text":"npm auditで出てくる脆弱性ってどれくらい真剣に対処するもんなんでしょうか。create-react-appするだけで脆弱性が58コ出てくる状況で